MAPPERS' NOTES
May 17. 
Dunes and S and SE need contours adjusting to Lidar
Southern area (south of Ashworths ponds)
needs complete redraw.
Wind damage from Sept. 2013 storm still
affecting runnability north-south unless indicated.</notes>
